= content_for :body_class, 'services'
/!  Section Main Content 
section.hero
	.container
		.row.justify-content-center
			.col-md-10.col-lg-10
					.squiggle
					h6.mb-3 Design + Development
					h1 Crafting Digital Experiences with Purpose & Precision
					p.lead.mb-4 From websites and landing pages to UX and UI solutions, I combine strategy, design, and development to create intuitive experiences that support your goals and connect with your audience.
					= link_to "Let's Work Together", contact_path, :class=>"btn btn-primary"

/!  Begin Page Content
section.quote
	.container
		.row.justify-content-center
			.col-lg-9
				= image_tag 'icons/icon-quote.svg', :class=>"img-fluid", alt: 'Customer testimonial'
				p.lead
					| "Working with Vanessa was a very pleasant experience. She was prompt in communicating, heard my needs and vision, made changes as requested, and was a pleasure to work with. My website was also completed prior to the projected date! I’m so happy with the final product, and will continue to utilize her services in the future as my business grows. Thanks Vanessa!"
				h6 
					| - Andrea M. Bayón, Founder of 
					= link_to "Mar Y Sol Therapy & Wellness", "https://marysolwellness.com/", target: "_blank"
section.pb-0
	.container
		.row.justify-content-center
			.col-lg-10
				.squiggle
				h2.text-center Digital solutions tailored to your goals.
section.webdesign
	.container
		.row.justify-content-center
			.col-lg-6
				h3 Website Strategy, Design & Development
				p Your website is more than just a digital space. It’s a powerful tool to engage your audience and support your business goals. From strategy and structure to design and development, I create custom websites tailored to your brand and audience. Each project is thoughtfully planned and built with a focus on usability, accessibility, performance, and long-term flexibility.
				h6 Capabilities include:
				ul.mb-4
					li Website Strategy & Discovery
					li Sitemaps & Information Architecture
					li Color Palette & Typography Pairing
					li Wireframes & High-fidelity Mockups
					li Custom WordPress & Shopify Development
					li Asset Preparation
					li Mobile Optimization
					li Analytics & Tracking
				p 
					i Every project is unique. Packages are tailored and quoted based on your specific business goals and requirements. 
					|
					/ b Investment: 
					/ | Projects start at $3,999. 
					b Typical Timeline: 
					| 8-12 weeks.
				= link_to "Let's Work Together", contact_path, :class=>"btn btn-secondary d-lg-none"
			.col-lg-6
				.top-0
					= link_to image_tag('portfolio/picnics/picnicsinthecity-showcase.jpg', alt: 'Vanessa Amilet - Web Design Services', :class=>"img-fluid end-0 border border-2 border-dark rounded-3"), portfolio_picnics_path
			

section.landingpg-design
	.container
		.row.justify-content-center
			.col-lg-6.position-relative
				.top-0
					= link_to image_tag('portfolio/reliant-mass/reliant-mass-landingpage.jpg', alt: 'Vanessa Amilet - Landing Page Design Services', :class=>"img-fluid end-0 border border-2 border-dark rounded-3"), portfolio_reliantmass_path
			.col-lg-6.
				h3 Landing Pages & Digital Campaigns
				p Launching a campaign, product, or new offer? I design and develop conversion-focused landing pages that guide users through a clear and engaging journey. Each experience is built with purpose, usability, and performance in mind to help drive meaningful engagement and results.
				h6 Capabilities include:
				ul
					li Landing Page Strategy & Sitemap
					li Custom Landing Page Design
					li High-Fidelity Mockups & Revisions
					li Color Palette & Typography Pairing
					li Email Marketing Design & Setup
					li Thank You Page
					li Responsive, Mobile-Optimized Landing Page
				p 
					i Packages are custom built & quoted based on your unique business needs and goals. 
					/ b Investment: 
					/ | Projects start at $1,799. 
					b Timeline: 
					| 3-4 weeks.
				= link_to "Let's Work Together", contact_path, :class=>"btn btn-secondary d-lg-none"
			
section.media.additional-services
	.container
		.row.justify-content-center
			.col-lg-6
				h3 Creative & Ongoing Support
				p Enhance your digital presence with brand-aligned assets designed to support your marketing, communication, and business needs. These offerings can be added to any website or landing page package or requested as standalone services.
				h6 Capabilities include:
				ul
					li Monthly Website Maintenance 
					li Email Template Designs
					li Custom Brand Iconography + Illustrations
					li Print & Marketing Collateral
					li Product Packaging Design
					li Social Media Graphics + Templates
				p 
					i Packages are custom built & quoted based on your unique business needs and goals. Please get in touch if you are interested in standalone services.
				= link_to "View My Work", portfolio_path, :class=>"btn btn-secondary d-lg-none"
			.col-lg-6.position-relative
				.top-0
					= link_to image_tag('portfolio/captivecolour/captivecolour-infocard.jpg', alt: 'Vanessa Amilet - Additional Offerings', :class=>"img-fluid end-0 border border-2 border-dark rounded-3"), portfolio_captivecolour_path

